  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2ad3a86e-499a-4ba9-9031-2da1644ce354-image.png\" style=\"width: 274px; height: 285px;\" /></p><p>Use parallel axis theorem to get the magnitude of the moment of inertia&nbsp;of a square plate of side&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;about the axis passing through one of the corners and perpendicular to the plane of a square plate,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>l</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>",
